Work added in EveryVideoTTS includes the EveryVideoTTS Studio UI, SRT subtitle
dubbing with timeline alignment, multi-speaker voice mapping, pitch-preserving
WSOLA speed matching, GPU-batched SRT generation and the "Review 1" /
"Review 2" preset voices.

