(pnnbao-ump/VieNeu-TTS*, pnnbao-ump/VieNeu-Codec) belong to their original
author and are not covered by the Apache License of this repository. The
upstream voice presets list them under CC BY-NC 4.0: non-commercial use only,
attribution required.

